    {
      "id": "tbb-requires-0bbcb7",
      "name": "__TBB_requires",
      "category": "parallel_reduce",
      "signature": "__TBB_requires(Body)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Body",
          "type": "tbb_range<Range>&& parallel_reduce_body<Body,Range> ) void parallel_reduce ( Range& range,Body&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<Range,Body>",
      "docs": "\\page parallel_reduce_body_req Requirements on parallel_reduce body\nClass \\c Body implementing the concept of parallel_reduce body must define:\n- \\code Body::Body( Body&, split ); \\endcode        Splitting constructor.\nMust be able to run concurrently with operator() and method \\c join\n- \\code Body::~Body(); \\endcode                     Destructor\n- \\code void Body::operator()( Range& r ); \\endcode Function call operator applying body to range \\c r\nand accumulating the result\n- \\code void Body::join( Body& b ); \\endcode        Join results.\nThe result in \\c b should be merged into the result of \\c this"
    },
